  "name": "qtbase-mkspecs-modules",
  "description": "This directory serves as the centralized registration and configuration point for Qt modules within the qmake build system. It facilitates the discovery and integration of individual Qt components by hosting .pri files that define module-specific metadata, include paths, and linking requirements. This modular architecture allows the Qt framework to dynamically adapt the build environment based on the specific set of libraries and tools available in the current installation.",
